# Go to Command runs Open Location in New Pane, which shows the same zoom in a second pane.
file <<END
Errands:
	- Post office
Work:
	- Report
END
keys G .
see 󰋜 › Work › Report
keys :
type open location
keys <Enter>
see │  󰋜 › Work › Report
see   - Report                                       │▌ - Report
